        <p class="c34" style="text-align: center; margin: 0;">
            <span class="c0" style="font-weight: 900; -webkit-text-stroke: 0.4px #000000;">APPLICATION FOR BANK GUARANTEE
                ISSUANCE</span>
        </p>
        <table class="party">
            <tr>
                <td style="text-align: left;"><span class="c14">To,</span></td>
                <td style="text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;"><span class="c14">Date: {{ date }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <p class="c29 c26"><span class="c14">The Branch Manager,</span></p>
        <p class="c29 c26"><span class="c14">AU Small Finance Bank,</span></p>
        <p class="c29 c26"><span class="c30">Plot No.- 24, Floor, Ring Road, Lajpat Nagar 4,<br>Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi
                &ndash; 110024.</span></p>
        <p class="c29 c21"><span class="c14"></span></p>
        <p class="c29 c26"><span class="c20">SUBJECT: FOR BANK GUARANTEE ISSUANCE:</span></p>
        <p class="c17"><span class="c14"></span></p>
        <p class="c29 c26"><span class="c0">Dear Sir/ Madam,</span></p>
        <p class="c17"><span class="c0"></span></p>
        <p class="c26 c29"><span class="c14">I/We hereby instruct you to Issue bank guarantee as per format enclosed
                as per details below</span></p>
        <p class="c17"><span class="c0"></span></p>
        <p class="c34 c26"><span class="c0">The bank guarantee is to be issued against our limit sanctioned by the
                Bank.</span></p>
        </div>
