        <p class="c18"><span class="c6">* I/We understand that the beneficiary can invoke the bank guarantee up to the
                BG Claim Period and our liability to the bank will also be till the date bank is not discharged from
                its liabilities in accordance with terms of the BG.</span></p>
        <p class="c18"><span class="c6">* In case the BG is open ended, I/We authorize the bank to extend the BG
                validity and recover charges from my account till the BG is not cancelled by the bank. </span></p>
        <p class="c28 c26"><span class="c6">* I have read and understood the terms of the sanction letter for issuance
                of BG limit and agreed to abide by the terms and conditions mentioned therein. I also understand that
                the terms and condition of sanction letter shall be applicable on the BG as well.</span></p>
        <p class="c17"><span class="c14"></span></p>
        <p class="c10 c26"><span class="c9">DECLARATION-CUM-UNDERTAKING UNDER FEMA </span><span class="c7">(Required in
                case of Foreign Bank Guarantee only)</span><span class="c6">&nbsp;I/We hereby declare that the
                transaction the details of which are specifically mentioned in this application does not involve, and
                is not designed for the purpose of any contravention or evasion of the provisions of the FEMA Act 1999
                or of any rules, regulation, notification, direction or order made there under. I /We also hereby agree
                and undertake to give such information/documents as will reasonably satisfy you about this transaction
                in terms of the above declaration. I/We also understand that if I/We refuse to comply with any such
                requirement or make only unsatisfactory compliance therewith, the bank shall refuse in writing to
